    "title": "Brady Basso appears for Aviators as team secures 11-2 victory on June 23",
    "text": "Former Pearland High School Ffa standout Brady Basso pitched for the Las Vegas Aviators on Tuesday, June 23, at 9:45 p.m., helping the team earn an 11-2 victory over the Sacramento River Cats in Minor League Baseball action.\nThe contest was held at Sutter Health Park. This matchup marked the fifth time the two teams faced off this season, with the Aviators trailing 1-4 in the season series prior to this game against the River Cats.\nBasso threw for 1.1 innings, allowing 1 hit while striking out 3 batters.\nThe Aviators will play their next game against the River Cats on Wednesday, June 24, at Sutter Health Park.\nBrady Basso — Pitcher — 6â€²2â€³ — 213 — Hometown: Pearland",
